flowchart LR
    Sources[Public product facts and real photographs] --> Intake[Reviewed local catalog manifest and asset provenance]
    Intake --> Seed[Idempotent owner API import]
    Seed --> Catalog[Catalog: models, details, SKUs, similar products]
    Seed --> Pricing[Pricing: INR and USD books]
    Seed --> Inventory[Inventory: audited synthetic stock]
    Seed --> Reviews[Reviews: labelled demo seed and moderation]
    Store[Storefront app :3000] --> Catalog
    Store --> Pricing
    Store --> Inventory
    Store --> Reviews
    Store --> Orders[Orders: owned delivered purchase checks]
    Reviews --> Orders
    Admin[Separate Admin app :3002] --> Catalog
    Admin --> Reviews
    Admin --> Ops[Operational APIs]
    CustomerID[Customer identity realm] --> Store
    OperatorID[Operator identity realm] --> Admin
    Guide[Verified UI access guide admin/admin] --> Admin
    Guide --> Tools[Kafka UI / Grafana / Prometheus / Trino / Neo4j / Superset / Keycloak]
